This repository includes a migrated Job Scout integration under
`integrations/job-scout/`. The upstream project is
https://github.com/jamwithai/observable-job-agent (imported from revision
`5839e4f`, before local privacy, workspace-path, and integration changes).
Its upstream MIT license is retained at `integrations/job-scout/LICENSE`.

The Career Workspace code outside that integration is distributed under the
root MIT license. Local changes to Job Scout include private-data isolation,
workspace integration, additional job sources, CV and cover-letter generation,
artifact handling, and evaluation coverage.
